## Keep build contexts small and hermetic.
## Anything listed here is NOT sent to the Docker daemon during `docker build`.

# Node / pnpm
**/node_modules
**/.pnpm-store
**/.pnpm-debug.log*
**/npm-debug.log*

# Build outputs (regenerated inside the image)
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/.next
**/.vite
**/coverage

# VCS + editor
.git
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.github
.vscode
.idea
**/.DS_Store

# Local env files — secrets never belong in an image
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Docs / repo-level junk
*.md
!README.md
docker-compose.dev.yml
docker-compose.prod.yml
docker-compose.https.yml
scripts
